# NOTE
# src/data/portfolio.config.json IS committed on purpose — it is the content of
# your site (which projects show, leadership entries, intro text).
# public/leadership/ and public/covers/ are committed too, for the same reason.
#
# If you would rather keep the admin UI source out of GitHub entirely, add:
#   src/admin/
# ...and delete the lazy import at the top of src/App.tsx. It is inert either
# way: the admin needs the Vite dev server to run and is stripped from builds.
